EmailTemplate.content:
Hello,

A lead that did not meet the current qualification threshold has been assigned to you for nurturing and re-engagement.

Applicant Details:
- Name: {!Lead.FirstName} {!Lead.LastName}
- Email: {!Lead.Email}
- Company: {!Lead.Company}

This lead may benefit from additional follow-up, educational resources, or periodic check-ins to move them toward qualification. Please add them to the appropriate nurture cadence.

Thank you,
Equity Builder Finance
